spec: S50-10

Questions through the CLI on their own Document `qa-plan`: the `questions:` line of `show` (TTY
and non-TTY), `answer` (TTY, non-TTY, `--json`, a no-op, `none`), a Question asked with
`thread new --ask`, `pull` writing the answers in, `push` refusing a file without them. Exit
paths of `answer`: 1 (an option that is not one), 2 (unknown key, unknown Document), 3 (no
credential), 5 (decided), 6 (unreachable). Merged stdout+stderr.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push qa-plan.md -q
qa-plan	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan show qa-plan
qa-plan	[..]	notes	v1 by @rowan [..]	action:-	open:0	actions:approve,send-back
questions: D1=- D2=-

$ annotary -p rowan answer qa-plan D1 A
D1	A

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p agent answer qa-plan D1 B
D1  B

$ annotary -p agent answer qa-plan D1 B --json
D1: it was already B
{"key":"D1","option":"B","version":1}

$ annotary -p agent answer qa-plan D2 none
D2: you had not answered it
D2	none

$ annotary -p agent answer qa-plan D2 C
D2	C

$ annotary -p rowan show qa-plan
qa-plan	[..]	notes	v1 by @rowan [..]	action:-	open:0	actions:approve,send-back
questions: D1=A@rowan,B@scribe D2=C

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan show qa-plan
qa-plan  [..]  notes  v1 by @rowan [..]  action:-  open:0  actions:approve,send-back  [URL]/d/[..]
questions: D1=A@rowan,B@scribe D2=C

$ annotary -p rowan answer qa-plan D1 Z
? 1
error: "Z" is not an option of D1: A, B, or other

$ annotary -p rowan answer qa-plan D9 A
? 2
error: no Question D9 in qa-plan ([..]) — `annotary show DOC` lists its Questions on the questions: line

$ annotary -p rowan answer no-such-doc D1 A
? 2
error: no Document "no-such-doc" — DOC is an id, a Name unique in the Vault, or the path to a pulled .md; `annotary list` shows Documents

$ annotary answer qa-plan D1 A
? 3
error: no credential — say who you are: pass -p NAME (`annotary profile list` shows whose each one is), or set ANNOTARY_TOKEN
profiles in ~/.annotary/config.toml: agent, down, limited, pw, rowan

$ annotary -p down answer qa-plan D1 A
? 6
error: server at http://127.0.0.1:1 not reachable — run `annotary serve` or `annotary daemon install`

$ annotary -p agent thread new qa-plan --document -m "Ship on Friday?" --ask Yes --ask "Wait a week"
t1	document

$ annotary -p rowan answer qa-plan t1 "wait a week"
t1	B

$ annotary -p rowan thread show qa-plan t1
t1	open	@scribe	document	created v1 [..]
  Ship on Friday?
  asks: A "Yes" B "Wait a week" · B@rowan

$ annotary -p rowan show qa-plan --json questions
{"questions":[{"key":"D1","source":"table","options":[{"id":"A","place":{"a":10,"b":10,"block":"li"}},{"id":"B","place":{"a":11,"b":11,"block":"li"}}],"rec":"A","row":5,"place":{"a":8,"b":8,"block":"h2"},"lines":[8,11],"answers":[{"by":"rowan","option":"A","at":"[..]","version":1},{"by":"scribe","option":"B","at":"[..]","version":1}]},{"key":"D2","source":"table","options":[{"id":"A","place":{"a":15,"b":15,"block":"li"}},{"id":"B","place":{"a":16,"b":16,"block":"li"}},{"id":"C","place":{"a":17,"b":17,"block":"li"}}],"rec":"B","row":6,"place":{"a":13,"b":13,"block":"h2"},"lines":[13,17],"answers":[{"by":"scribe","option":"C","at":"[..]","version":1}]},{"key":"t1","source":"thread","options":[{"id":"A","label":"Yes"},{"id":"B","label":"Wait a week"}],"thread":"t1","answers":[{"by":"rowan","option":"B","at":"[..]","version":1}]}]}

$ sh edit-qa.sh

$ annotary -p rowan push qa-plan.md
? 5
error: D1, D2 answered on v1 are not in the Decided cells of qa-plan.md — put these rows in and push again (`annotary pull` writes them in; --discard-answers pushes without them)
line 5: | D1 | A, B | A | A (@rowan), B (@scribe) |
line 6: | D2 | A, B, C | B | C (@scribe, [..]) |

$ annotary -p rowan pull qa-plan --force
pull: 1 thread, 0 assets
2 answers written into the decisions table; push to record them
qa-plan.md	qa-plan.annotary	v1

$ annotary -p rowan push qa-plan.md -q
qa-plan	[..]	v2

$ annotary -p rowan show qa-plan
qa-plan	[..]	notes	v2 by @rowan [..]	action:-	open:1	actions:approve,send-back
questions: D1=decided D2=decided t1=B
t1	@scribe	document	Ship on Friday?	[..]

$ annotary -p rowan answer qa-plan D1 B
? 5
error: D1 is decided in the Document ("A (@rowan), B (@scribe)"); its controls are closed — the Version records the decision; change the Decided cell in a new Version to reopen it

$ annotary answer --help
Usage: annotary answer DOC KEY OPTION|none [--vault NAME]

KEY is a row of the Document's decisions table (a table with Decision, Options and Decided columns:
D4) or a Thread that asks a Question (t7, from `thread new … --ask`). OPTION is an option id (A), a
Thread Question's label, `other` (say what in the Question's Thread) or `none` to withdraw yours.
One answer per Member; answering again replaces it. An answer is not a mention: it wakes nobody.
`show DOC` prints them (`questions: D4=B D5=-`); `pull` writes the head's into the Decided cells.
Exit 5 when the Question is decided (its Decided cell is filled) or head moved. Needs `comment`.
Prints `KEY  OPTION`; `--json` → {key,option,changed,version}.

```
